  _senarioDescription: "You manage to squeeze yourself under the table. Moments after
    the creature slowly comes into the room. As it approaches you can hear its deep
    breaths getting closer. It almost sounds like it\u2019s sniffing the air. The
    breathing gets louder and louder suddenly the breathing stops. You lay here frozen
    in fear as the chair in front of the desk is wheeled away. Your final thought,
    you wish you hid better. \\nThey found us guys - Ending "
